<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - No Tenders.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - No Tenders.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>No Australian promissory note tenders were held on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Money market torpor has continued in the run up to Tuesday's U.S. Federal Open Market Committee meeting.</p>
<p>The bank bill yield curve was little moved over the morning while December bank bill futures were changing hands two points higher at 93.30 at 0140 GMT (11.40 a.m.).</p>
